    (property "Note" "With Rth = 4.489k, fc = 35.5 kHz -- 23.6x above the 1500 Hz tooth rate at rated speed and 237x above the 150 Hz cranking rate. MATCHED to the other leg: a mismatch here converts common-mode harness noise into differential noise at exactly the frequencies the filter exists to remove." (id 4) (at 110.0 133.0 0)
